@startuml get-cheers
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/cheers
caption CRB-37 · 현업자 정보 카드 목록 (정렬: 최근 가입 · 최근 접속 · 랜덤)\nCRB-68 · 회사는 company_alias 이름 + 로고 presigned GET URL

actor Client
participant "UserGuard\n+ UserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "CheersStudentController" as Controller
participant "CheersStudentService" as Service
participant "GraduatedCardRepository" as GraduatedCardRepository
participant "FileService" as FileService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/cheers?sort=&page=&size=\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard
  UserGuard, UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @UserTypes(["student", "graduated"]). 가입을 마친(active) 재학생 · 현업자
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
  403 Signup is not completed
end ref
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (sort가 recent_joined · recent_active · random 이 아님,\npage < 1, size < 1 또는 > 50, 정수가 아님)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
note right of Pipe: 기본값 sort = recent_joined, page = 1, size = 20
Pipe -> Controller: getGraduatedList(query)
Controller -> Service: getGraduatedList(query)

Service -> Service: offset = (page - 1) * size
Service -> Service: seed = floor(now / CHEERS_RANDOM_SEED_MINUTES분)
note right of Service
  항상 계산하고 sort = random일 때만 쓰임.
  CHEERS_RANDOM_SEED_MINUTES 기본 60.
  같은 구간 안에서는 seed가 같아 페이지를 넘겨도 순서가 유지됨.
  구간이 바뀌는 순간 넘기면 중복 · 누락이 생길 수 있음
end note

par 동시에 조회 — 같은 조건
  Service -> GraduatedCardRepository: findPage({ sort, offset, limit: size, seed })
  GraduatedCardRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT g.pk, gp.nickname, COALESCE(ca.name, gp.company) AS company, ca.logo_key, gp.job,\ngp.hashtags, gp.links, u.last_active_at,\nCOALESCE(c.kakao_enabled OR c.email_enabled, false) AS can_request\nFROM graduated g JOIN users u JOIN graduated_profile gp\nLEFT JOIN company_alias ca ON ca.pk = gp.company_alias_pk\nLEFT JOIN coffee_chat_contact c\nWHERE u.type = 'graduated' AND u.status = 'active'\nAND g.verified_at IS NOT NULL AND isActiveAccount\nORDER BY <sort>, g.pk LIMIT size OFFSET offset
  note right
    isActiveAccount (user.sql.ts) = is_deleted = false
    AND withdraw_requested_at IS NULL → 탈퇴 · 탈퇴 유예기간 중인 현업자 제외
    verified_at IS NOT NULL → 어드민이 명함 인증을 취소한 현업자 제외 (CRB-44)
    정렬: recent_joined = gp.created_at DESC
    recent_active = u.last_active_at DESC
    random = md5(g.pk || seed)
    이름 · 부서 · 연락처는 select하지 않음.
    company: 이전 버전 pod가 회사 없이 저장한 프로필(company_alias_pk NULL)은 저장 당시 입력값
  end note
  GraduatedCardRepository --> Service: rows
else
  Service -> GraduatedCardRepository: (count)
  GraduatedCardRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 FROM · WHERE)
  GraduatedCardRepository --> Service: total
end
note right of Service: 트랜잭션 없음 (조회만)

Service -> FileService: getPresignedUrls(rows.logo_key)
note right
  서버에서 서명만 계산 (S3 호출 없음).
  같은 회사 현업자가 여러 명이어도 key당 한 번
end note
Service -> Service: hashtags · links가 null이면 [],\nlast_active_at ISO 8601,\ncompany_logo_url = 서명 URL | null (로고 없음)
Service --> Controller: { items, page, size, total }
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: CheersCardDto[], page, size, total }

@enduml
